## 13.5. Doors ✅ COMPLETE

Doors are interactables with optional locking. Lockable doors have four authored configuration axes:

- **Schedule hours** (`time_open`, `time_close`)
- **Owner-NPC unlock** (`owner_npc`, `owner_home_scene`) — additive over schedule, never subtractive
- **Late lockout** (`late_lockout`) — modifier on owner-presence path only
- **Hard-locked days** (`locked_days`) — bitfield of days the door is hard-locked

Lock resolution: hard-locked days override; else schedule hours; else owner-present-and-not-late-lockout. Notification message switches on the active path.

